<title>POLAND: DOM PLAST SWINGS TO PROFIT IN OCTOBER.</title>
<headline>DOM PLAST SWINGS TO PROFIT IN OCTOBER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.71 vs   0.16 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.44 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.38 vs   0.49</p>
<p> Sales		    6.67 vs   7.16</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.77 vs   3.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.80 vs   5.62</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.28 vs   6.82</p>
<p> Sales		   61.11 vs  66.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic houseware maker is Dom</p>
<p>Plast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
